{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00327",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.61,
      "end_seconds": 4.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "Doctor? Hi. I hope I've got the right time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.07,
      "end_seconds": 9.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "That's alright, take a seat. Tell me why you've come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.35,
      "end_seconds": 24.06,
      "duration_seconds": 10.71,
      "text": "Yeah, it's pain in my lower back. I don't know what's causing it. My sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.7,
      "end_seconds": 27.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Is this recent, or has it been a while?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 28.93,
      "end_seconds": 36.14,
      "duration_seconds": 7.21,
      "text": "Oh, it's been like this since this morning. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.73,
      "end_seconds": 40.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "Do you notice anything setting it off?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.83,
      "end_seconds": 54.12,
      "duration_seconds": 13.29,
      "text": "Right, yes, sitting for long. That makes it worse. Well, I've also had a muscle spasm, since last Tuesday. Oh, and stiffness. Had that since Friday. As for stiffness, it's mild, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.41,
      "end_seconds": 72.12,
      "duration_seconds": 16.71,
      "text": "What I'm doing here is putting together three things: what you tell me, what I find when I examine you, and what the tests show. None of those alone is enough, which is why we sometimes need to wait for results before being certain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.55,
      "end_seconds": 74.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "I appreciate you explaining that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.8,
      "end_seconds": 78.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Any numbness around the groin or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.39,
      "end_seconds": 84.69,
      "duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "text": "No, uh, no numbness around the groin or weight loss."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.64,
      "end_seconds": 90.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.69,
      "text": "Any weakness in the legs, bladder problems or numbness in the legs at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.03,
      "end_seconds": 97.45,
      "duration_seconds": 6.42,
      "text": "No weakness in the legs, bladder problems or numbness in the legs, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.17,
      "end_seconds": 101.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "Anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.72,
      "end_seconds": 104.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "No, that's all normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.37,
      "end_seconds": 111.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "Any medication at the moment, including things from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.27,
      "end_seconds": 114.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "Diclofenac, 50 milligrams, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.16,
      "end_seconds": 115.86,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.88,
      "end_seconds": 120.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "I take paracetamol, 500 milligrams, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.61,
      "end_seconds": 122.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "Any allergies I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.25,
      "end_seconds": 125.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "Yes, peanuts, it gives me hives."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.24,
      "end_seconds": 130.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "Do you have any questions before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.1,
      "end_seconds": 142.54,
      "duration_seconds": 11.44,
      "text": "Uh, not at the moment, I think you've covered most of what I was wondering. If something comes to mind later, I'll ask you before I leave."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.41,
      "end_seconds": 148.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.89,
      "text": "Any long-term health problems I should know about? Take your time, there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.62,
      "end_seconds": 150.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "I've got arthritis in my knees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.85,
      "end_seconds": 153.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "Let me check your vitals now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 162.71,
      "end_seconds": 164.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.33,
      "text": "Just relax your arm..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.93,
      "end_seconds": 180.9,
      "duration_seconds": 6.97,
      "text": "Okay: pulse 77, SpO2 98 percent on room air, temp 36.8 degrees, pressure 118 over 68."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 181.97,
      "end_seconds": 183.38,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.49,
      "end_seconds": 187.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "We'll put it in context in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.35,
      "end_seconds": 192.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Okay, let's do a quick examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.41,
      "end_seconds": 194.11,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.48,
      "end_seconds": 197.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "Alright, bear with me a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.12,
      "end_seconds": 219.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.67,
      "text": "Straight leg raise is negative on both sides and power in the legs is normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.68,
      "end_seconds": 222.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "Hold your arm out like this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.01,
      "end_seconds": 235.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "There's tenderness over the muscles on the right of the lower back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 236.22,
      "end_seconds": 236.92,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Hm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.5,
      "end_seconds": 262.17,
      "duration_seconds": 22.67,
      "text": "That's fine, you can get dressed. Good, that's all I need to examine. Let me gather my thoughts and then we'll talk it through together. So, based on the history and the examination, I think we're dealing with mechanical low back pain at this stage. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 262.83,
      "end_seconds": 266.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Is it something serious, uh, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.49,
      "end_seconds": 285.78,
      "duration_seconds": 18.29,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like mechanical low back pain, but I'd like to confirm. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had pain in your lower back, since this morning, and no bladder problems or numbness in the legs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 286.48,
      "end_seconds": 289.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "Exactly, um, that's what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.91,
      "end_seconds": 294.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "Is there anything you were hoping to get out of today's visit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 296.1,
      "end_seconds": 300.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.85,
      "text": "Okay, so mostly I just want to understand what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.54,
      "end_seconds": 310.4,
      "duration_seconds": 8.86,
      "text": "Let's get an X-ray of the lower back, for back pain. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 311.67,
      "end_seconds": 313.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "Okay, um, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 314.78,
      "end_seconds": 320.1,
      "duration_seconds": 5.32,
      "text": "Let's use thiocolchicoside, 4 milligrams, twice a day, for five days. It's for muscle spasm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 321.5,
      "end_seconds": 324.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "Alright, I'll pick it up today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 325.19,
      "end_seconds": 346.36,
      "duration_seconds": 21.17,
      "text": "Staying gently active heals back pain faster than bed rest, so keep moving. Every hour, get up and stretch if you're at a desk. A short walk every day, even twenty minutes, will help more than you'd think. I want you to come back or go to emergency straight away if you get numbness in the groin or lose bladder control."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 347.11,
      "end_seconds": 349.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9,
      "text": "Yes, I'll do that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 350.0,
      "end_seconds": 351.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "Come back in two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 352.76,
      "end_seconds": 354.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.72,
      "text": "Okay, I'll book that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 355.12,
      "end_seconds": 359.93,
      "duration_seconds": 4.81,
      "text": "Can you run through the plan with me quickly, just to be certain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 360.81,
      "end_seconds": 369.83,
      "duration_seconds": 9.02,
      "text": "So, I take the thiocolchicoside, 4 milligrams, twice a day and come back in two weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 370.46,
      "end_seconds": 373.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Good. Look after yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 374.33,
      "end_seconds": 378.6,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "Okay, thank you. I'll get started on all of that."
    }
  ]
}